    "homeType": "CONDO",
    "description": "On a quiet corner in Noe Valley behind a lush garden sits 1816 Castro Street. Classic Victorian charm blends seamlessly with modern updates. This 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom condominium offers a wonderful opportunity for first-time homebuyers, investors or pied-a-terre owners. An inviting front patio leads to the formal entry while an open dining room and chef's kitchen provide the focal point of the home. A king-sized bed fits nicely in the primary bedroom with great storage in the two closets. The second bedroom has great light and could be utilized as a home office or additional living space. Just outside the kitchen is another private patio and the dedicated laundry and storage room. Two car parking on the parking pad and shared storage beneath the home offer added convenience. Sitting on a corner lot, the verdant shared garden wraps around the property creating a park-like surrounding. This lovely home is located blocks from the shopping, eateries and bars on 24th Street while also offering easy access to transit and freeways. Welcome home!"
  },
